meta {
  name: Export Bundle
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exports/bundle.zip
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  ~from: 2026-01-01
  ~to: 2026-12-31
  ~date_basis: entry
  ~account_id: 1
  ~include_descendants: true
  ~commodity_id: 1
}

docs {
  The scoped export: ledger, reference tables, a trial balance that reconciles
  it, and a manifest with a SHA-256 per file, written last so a truncated
  download fails to open. Filters select whole journal entries, so the archive
  balances per entry however it is scoped — and carries postings the filter did
  not name. See docs/adrs/0011-ledger-export-contract.md.
}
